---
// src/components/About.astro
---
<section id="about" class="container">
  <div class="about-grid">
    
    <div class="about-statement">
      <h2 class="heading-font">Demystifying Complexity.</h2>
      <p class="subtitle">My core motivation is translating intricate systems into human-centric solutions.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-details">
      <p>
        I am a Computer Science undergraduate specializing in Database Technology. I find my greatest joy at the intersection of logic and human understanding. 
      </p>
      <p>
        Whether I am working as a private mathematics tutor—breaking down complex abstract concepts into digestible, step-by-step methodologies for my students—or engineering a backend data pipeline, my philosophy remains the same: <strong>technology should bring clarity, not confusion.</strong>
      </p>
      <p>
        My current interest lies in deeply understanding Explainable AI (XAI) and scalable data architectures. I am driven by the desire to step out of the conventional classroom environment and collaborate with diverse minds to build products that are not only technically robust, but fundamentally empathetic to the user's needs.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  #about {
    padding-top: 4rem;
    padding-bottom: 6rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr; 
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-statement h2 {
    font-size: 4rem;
    line-height: 1.1;
    color: var(--accent-color);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .about-statement .subtitle {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text-color);
    opacity: 0.8;
  }

  .about-details { padding-top: 1rem; }
  .about-details p { font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-color); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .about-details strong { font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent-color); }

  @media print {
    #about { padding-top: 2rem; padding-bottom: 3rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; page-break-inside: avoid; }
    .about-statement h2 { font-size: 3rem; }
    .about-details p { font-size: 1.05rem; }
  }

  /* --- MOBILE RESPONSIVE --- */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    #about { padding-top: 2rem; padding-bottom: 3rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
    .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2rem; }
    .about-statement h2 { font-size: 2.8rem; }
  }
</style>